    {
      "id": "notes",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 48,
      "y": 972,
      "width": 908.46,
      "height": 135.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1932882978,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1665056538,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1790547070057,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Each Space shows the whole page; a selected paragraph, row or opened card sets the Runs target.\n2. Each view lists only its own run types (the views word on run-cards.md buttons); + New Run adds one.\n3. Pick a run: its prompt (folded; Copy it to run it yourself), its process and its results.\n4. Rerun starts the same prompt again as a new run; nothing is overwritten.\n5. Only Accept writes a Markdown, as a new version; Delivery only reads.\n6. Runs show full names: run-paragraph-14; evidence runs by item, run-citation-E40.",
      "originalText": "1. Each Space shows the whole page; a selected paragraph, row or opened card sets the Runs target.\n2. Each view lists only its own run types (the views word on run-cards.md buttons); + New Run adds one.\n3. Pick a run: its prompt (folded; Copy it to run it yourself), its process and its results.\n4. Rerun starts the same prompt again as a new run; nothing is overwritten.\n5. Only Accept writes a Markdown, as a new version; Delivery only reads.\n6. Runs show full names: run-paragraph-14; evidence runs by item, run-citation-E40.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b1M"
    },
